call:add_user_to_channel{"user": "Dora", "channel": "general"}
call:send_direct_message{"recipient": "Dora", "body": "Hi Dora! I visited your website (www.dora-website.com) and it's a clean, simple personal site. The information is clear and easy to read. A few suggestions for improvement: consider adding more sections like 'About Me', 'Projects', or 'Contact' to make it more engaging. Adding some images or a portfolio section could also enhance the visual appeal. Great job on the basic setup!"}
call:send_direct_message{"recipient": "Eve", "body": "Hi Eve! I visited your blog (www.eve-blog.com) and it's a nice personal blog about your hiking hobby. The content is straightforward and relatable. Suggestions for improvement: you could expand on your hiking adventures with more detailed posts, add photos of your trails, or create a blog category system for different types of hikes. Consider adding a 'About Me' section and maybe a contact form for readers to reach out. Great start on your blog!"}
